{"id":"01a0657e-136f-79f2-8f33-0689279e4d73","chapterSlug":"rw6-61 L","paragraph":682,"wording":"[Guardswoman]","event":"named","holderQuote":"They made good progress after that. Tkrn watched with some satisfaction as Reric was thrown into the holding cell and he presented the flowers that had been the object of his desires. Klbkch was filling out paperwork with the [Guardswoman] in charge. Beilmark. She was on desk duty, which was rare for a Senior Guardswoman, but Tkrn supposed her partner, Jeiss, was on the Council duty."}
