{"id":"01a0657e-136f-7d5b-8410-f321d68ff938","chapterSlug":"rw7-16 L","paragraph":414,"wording":"[Guardswoman]","event":"named","holderSlug":"zevara","holderQuote":"She eyed Lyonette. And suddenly the [Princess] was in the hot seat. Zevara had been a [Guardswoman] and then a Senior Guardswoman before becoming Watch Captain. One of Liscor’s best. She had put away the Drake gang leader before Mister Soot—or rather, got him exiled."}
{"id":"01a0657e-136f-7e46-9ee9-b814f92c8e8d","chapterSlug":"rw7-16 L","paragraph":514,"wording":"[Guardswoman]","event":"named","holderSlug":"lyonette","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"jeiss","holderQuote":"“Thanks, Watch Captain. But Miss Lyonette isn’t that bad. She could be a [Guardswoman] with only a month or two’s hard work.”"}
